<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/short-stories:00027/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>20██/██/██ ██:██, 地点：██████</p>
<hr />
<p>下层叙事安保部门生存指南：</p>
<p>别被写到任何一个条目的探索日志里，他们都死无全尸。</p>
<hr />
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;评论区&nbsp;1个</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;评论区</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/account-delete" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6419401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6419401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606225867" alt="Account Delete" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6419401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/account-delete" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6419401); return false;">Account Delete</a></span>：</strong>解读：讽刺一些SCP的探索小队总是被全灭，然而他们却是“成功执行多次任务，经验丰富”的。</p>
</blockquote>
