<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/account-delete" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6419401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6419401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606225867" alt="Account Delete" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6419401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/account-delete" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6419401); return false;">Account Delete</a></span></p>
