<blockquote>
<p><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/josephjoestar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6159447); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6159447&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606225868" alt="JosephJoestar" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6159447)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/josephjoestar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6159447); return false;">JosephJoestar</a></span>：<span style="color: green">草</span></strong></p>
